 indeed"}],"gloss":"you indeed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வியலிடம்","parts":[{"text":"வியல்","lemma":"viyal","gloss":"wide"},{"text":"இடம்","lemma":"iṭam","gloss":"world"}],"gloss":"wide world"},{"surface":"கமழ","parts":[{"text":"கமழ","lemma":"kamaḻ","gloss":"to spread fame"}],"gloss":"to spread fame"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இவன்இசை","parts":[{"text":"இவன்இசை","lemma":"இவன்இசை","gloss":"fame in this world"}],"gloss":"fame in this world","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உடையோர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"உடையோர்க்கு","lemma":"uṭaiyōr","gloss":"to those who possess"}],"gloss":"to those who possess"},{"surface":"அல்லது","parts":[{"text":"அல்லது","lemma":"allatu","gloss":"except"}],"gloss":"except"},{"surface":"அவணது","parts":[{"text":"அவண்","lemma":"avaṇ","gloss":"there"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"atu","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of that upper world"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உயர்நிலை","parts":[{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"uyar","gloss":"high"},{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"nilai","gloss":"state"}],"gloss":"high-state"},{"surface":"உலகத்து","parts":[{"text":"உலகத்து","lemma":"ulaku","gloss":"of the world"}],"gloss":"of the world"},{"surface":"உறையுள்","parts":[{"text":"உறையுள்","lemma":"uṟaiyuḷ","gloss":"abode"}],"gloss":"abode"},{"surface":"இன்மை","parts":[{"text":"இன்மை","lemma":"iṉmai","gloss":"absence"}],"gloss":"absence"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விளங்கக்","parts":[{"text":"விளங்கக்","lemma":"விளங்கக்","gloss":"clearly"}],"gloss":"clearly","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கேட்ட","parts":[{"text":"கேட்ட","lemma":"kēḷ","gloss":"having heard"}],"gloss":"having heard"},{"surface":"மாறுகொல்","parts":[{"text":"மாறு","lemma":"māṟu","gloss":"reason"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is it because?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வலம்படு","parts":[{"text":"வலம்","lemma":"valam","gloss":"victory"},{"text":"படு","lemma":"paṭu","gloss":"producing"}],"gloss":"victorious"},{"surface":"குருசில்","parts":[{"text":"குருசில்","lemma":"kurucil","gloss":"lord"}],"gloss":"lord"},{"surface":"நீ","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"nī","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you"},{"surface":"ஈங்குஇது","parts":[{"text":"ஈங்கு","lemma":"īṅku","gloss":"here"},{"text":"இது","lemma":"itu","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this here"},{"surface":"செயலே","parts":[{"text":"செயல்","lemma":"ceyal","gloss":"action"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"action indeed"}]}],"literal":"Without blemish bound, having leather straps, of the leather band / dark-colored sides to look beautiful, peacock's / dense long feathers, bright spots, gem-like garland / golden ear ornament, along with uḻiñai shoots, to shine, having adorned / blood thirst, dread-inspiring war drum / having washed, before returning, time, oil / scooped-up foam like soft flower bed / not knowing, who lay upon, me, dreadfully / into two parts cutting, your sword's edge, that you spared / that itself is sufficient, good Tamil entirely knowing / with that also not being satisfied, to approach, having come, your / strong drum-like shoulders having raised, coolly / having fanned, you indeed, wide world to spread fame / fame in this world to those who possess, except, of that upper world / high-state world's abode, absence / clearly having heard, is it because? / victorious lord, you, this here action indeed!","translation":"The war drum, tightly bound with flawless leather straps, its dark sides adorned beautifully with dense, long peacock feathers with bright spots like a gem-garland, and crowned with golden ornaments and uḻiñai shoots, has a dread-inspiring thirst for blood. Before it was brought back from being washed, I, not knowing, lay upon its soft flower bed which resembled scooped-up foam. That you spared your sword's edge, which cuts into two, from dreadfully striking me, is itself proof enough of your deep understanding of good Tamil. But not stopping with that, you approached me, raised your strong, drum-like shoulders, and fanned me coolly so that your fame spreads across the wide world. O victorious lord! Is it because you have clearly heard that there is no place in the high heavenly world for anyone other than those who possess fame in this world, that you did this here?","modern":"குற்றமில்லாமல் இறுக்கிக் கட்டப்பட்ட வார்ப்புகளைக் கொண்ட தோல் வாரினால், கரிய பக்கங்கள் அழகுபெற, மயிலின் அடர்ந்த நீண்ட பீலிகளையும், ஒளிரும் புள்ளிகளையுடைய மணிமாலை போன்ற பொலங்குழையையும், உழிஞைப் பூக்களையும் அழகுபெறச் சூட்டி, குருதி வேட்கை கொண்ட அச்சம் தரும் முரசு வைக்கப்படும் கட்டிலில், அது நீராட்டப்பட்டுத் திரும்புவதற்கு முன்னால், அதன் எண்ணெய் பூசப்பட்ட, நுரை போன்ற மென்மையான மலர்ப்படுக்கையில், நான் அறியாமல் ஏறித் தூங்கினேன். அவ்வாறு தூங்கிய என்னை, உடலை இருகூறாக வெட்டும் உனது கூர்மையான வாளுக்கு இரையாக்காமல் தப்பவிட்டாயே, அதுவே நீ நல்ல தமிழ் முழுவதையும் அறிந்தவன் என்பதற்குச் சான்றாகும். அதோடு மட்டும் நின்றுவிடாமல், என் அருகில் வந்து, உனது வலிமையான தோள்களை உயர்த்தி, குளிர்ந்த காற்று வீசுமாறு கவரி வீசினாயே! வெற்றி பொருந்திய தலைவனே! இவ்வுலகில் புகழ் உடையவர்களுக்கே அன்றி, புகழ் இல்லாதவர்களுக்கு மேலுலகத்தில் இடம் இல்லை என்பதை நீ தெளிவாகக் கேட்டறிந்த காரணத்தினால்தான் இத்தகைய செயலைச் செய்தாயோ?","explanation":"The poet Mōcikīraṉār addresses the Cēra king, Cēramāṉ Takaṭūr Eṟinta Peruñcēral Irumpoṟai, in a state of profound gratitude. Having arrived exhausted at the palace, the poet accidentally fell asleep on the sacred royal drum-bed while the war drum was away being ceremonially bathed. Sleeping on this bed was a capital offense, but when the king found him, instead of executing him, he gently fanned the sleeping poet with a fly-whisk. The poet praises the king's deep love for Tamil and Tamil scholars, which prevented him from using his sword. The poem contrasts the terrifying, bloodthirsty nature of the war drum with the soft, foam-like bed of flowers to highlight the poet's narrow escape. Ultimately, the poet attributes the king's extraordinary humility to his desire to earn lasting fame on earth, which is the only key to entering the heavenly world.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.34],[0.34,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,2.05],[2.05,2.8],[2.8,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.5,4.5],[4.5,4.9],[4.9,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,7.44],[7.44,7.8],[7.8,8.4],[8.4,8.7],[8.7,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.2],[10.2,10.5],[10.5,11.28],[11.28,11.8],[11.8,12.1],[12.1,12.46],[12.82,13.8],[13.8,14.04],[14.1,14.6],[14.6,15.24],[15.24,15.73],[15.73,16.1],[16.1,16.6],[16.6,17.0],[18.04,18.64],[18.64,19.24],[19.24,19.64],[19.64,20.14],[20.14,21.24],[21.24,21.64],[21.64,21.87],[21.87,22.54],[22.54,22.94],[22.94,23.94],[23.94,24.54],[24.54,24.74],[24.74,24.94],[24.94,25.24],[25.24,26.44],[26.44,27.14],[27.14,27.84],[28.07,28.3],[28.3,28.53],[28.53,28.99],[28.99,30.14],[30.14,30.41],[30.54,31.54],[31.54,32.14],[32.14,32.34],[32.34,32.74],[32.74,34.04],[34.04,34.44],[34.44,34.64],[34.64,35.04],[35.04,35.79],[35.79,36.24],[36.24,36.44],[37.56,38.16],[38.16,38.36],[38.36,38.76],[38.76,39.36],[39.36,39.76]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.2,1.8],[1.8,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,4.0],[4.0,5.07],[5.07,5.5],[5.5,6.3],[6.3,6.8],[6.8,7.59],[7.59,8.37],[8.37,9.0],[9.0,9.3],[9.3,10.1],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,10.8],[10.8,11.1],[11.1,11.94],[11.94,12.5],[12.5,12.8],[12.8,13.6],[13.6,14.72],[14.72,15.1],[15.1,15.6],[15.6,16.24],[16.24,16.73],[16.73,17.1],[17.1,17.6],[17.6,18.0],[19.16,19.76],[19.76,20.36],[20.36,20.96],[20.96,21.46],[21.46,22.66],[22.66,23.06],[23.06,23.31],[23.31,24.06],[24.06,24.56],[24.56,25.56],[25.56,26.16],[26.16,26.36],[26.36,26.66],[26.66,26.96],[26.96,28.06],[28.06,28.66],[28.66,29.06],[29.06,29.36],[29.36,30.09],[30.09,30.46],[30.46,31.06],[31.06,31.33],[31.46,32.03],[32.03,32.71],[32.71,33.16],[33.16,33.56],[33.56,34.24],[34.24,34.92],[34.92,35.46],[35.46,35.86],[35.86,36.97],[37.16,37.56],[37.56,38.4],[38.4,39.46],[39.46,39.76],[39.76,40.36],[40.36,40.96],[40.96,41.36]]},"sync":[[["மாசற","without blemish"]],[["விசித்த","tightly bound"]],[["வார்புஉறு","having leather straps"]],[["வள்பின்","of the leather band"]],[["மைபடு","dark-colored"]],[["மருங்